<title>SRI LANKA: WEATHER-Sri Lanka weather forecast.</title>
<headline>WEATHER-Sri Lanka weather forecast.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Saturday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    0</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		0</p>
<p>    Norton		    0</p>
<p>    Polgolla		  0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   0</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>Dry weather will continue to prevail all over the island on Sunday, the department forecast said.</p>
